OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy,
OL,6,Fwindy and mild overnight, with a few
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain, most likely across
OL,8,Fnorthern parts of the region, where
OL,9,Fthey may become persistent towards
OL,10,Fdawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FCloudy and windy Thursday,
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of rain affecting the
OL,14,Fregion for much of the day before
OL,15,Fclearing southeastwards during the
OL,16,Fevening. Winds will gradually ease
OL,17,Flater in the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
